  (text "Mushroom blocks: a = coil chain (+24V_L -> S1a -> S2a -> COIL+), b = logic (3V3 -> S1b -> S2b -> ESTOP_CH2),\nc = U20 ch1 (T11 -> S1c -> S2c -> U27 -> T12), d = U20 ch2 (T21 -> S1d -> S2d -> T22).\nChassis parts (Location = chassis) are drawn for the net list; they connect through the board's studs and connectors." (at 25.4 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9306a60b-1eb3-5dae-bb97-2e5595b3768b"))
